# Rules local to this product. Everything general -- build directories, CMake
# output, the ASIO SDK's filenames, captures, the guidance documents -- is at the
# repository root and applies here already.

# Rack presets and scan caches written while testing. Derived state that names
# absolute paths on whichever machine produced it.
*.rack
scancache
pluginindex

# tools/local/ — rigs that drive the RUNNING product rather than its sources: the XTest window
# driver, the channel stomper, the state seeder and the geometry probe. See tools/local/README.md
# for what each one measures.
#
# Untracked as a category, not for being unfinished. Each needs something a phase gate may never
# depend on — a live X server, libXtst, a running JACK server, a built bundle, a directory of
# captures — and a gate that needs a window server is a gate that cannot run. The tracked gate on
# the same code is tools/panelrender.cpp, which renders every page offline and audits the art.
#
# Anchored here rather than at the root, so it means THIS product's tools directory and not any
# other's.
tools/local/

# Renders written by panelrender and rackrender when either is run from this directory. See the
# note on the same rule at the repository root.
/*.png
